abstract = {Weapon target assignment (WTA) problem is the problem of assigning weapons to targets with the objective of minimizing the expected damage of targets. In this work, a GA with a novel crossover operator is proposed for the particular WTA problem. The idea is to use a benefit level to identify good genes. The proposed algorithm is implemented and tested with a number of randomly generated WTA instances. The proposed algorithm outperforms its competitors on all test problems.},
